{"step_index":342,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-05T20:07:01Z","content":"### 🎉 **Implementation Complete: All Bonus Features & Modern Welcome Page Are Live!**\n\nThe **DevOps Qualification Verification System (QVS 2.0)** has been upgraded with all 5 bonus requirement areas and a modern responsive Welcome / Landing page.\n\n---\n\n### 🌟 **What Was Implemented & Delivered**\n\n#### **1. Modern, Responsive Welcome / Landing Page** ([`index.html`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/resources/templates/index.html))\n- **Hero Banner**: Animated typography, radiant glow backdrop, and automated CI/CD & blockchain trust badges.\n- **Live Statistics Counters**: Real-time counter cards showing qualifications notarized, blockchain blocks, and zero-downtime DevOps metrics.\n- **Instant Credential Verifier**:\n  - Live search input for certificate numbers or SHA-256 hashes.\n  - 1-Click Demo test buttons: `Sarah Jenkins (Genuine)`, `David Miller (Genuine)`, `Marcus Vance (Revoked)`, `Fake Cert (Invalid)`.\n  - Rich result cards displaying graduate parameters, SHA-256 fingerprint, blockchain transaction height, and AI risk score.\n- **Interactive \"How It Works\" Flow**: 3-step visualization (Accredited University Issuance ➔ Blockchain Mining ➔ Public Instant Verification).\n- **Responsive Navigation**: Adapts to desktop, tablet, and mobile with a collapsible hamburger menu.\n\n#### **2. Blockchain Credential Ledger (Bonus Feature 1)**\n- [`Block.java`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/java/com/devops/qvs/model/Block.java) & [`BlockchainLedgerService.java`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/java/com/devops/qvs/service/BlockchainLedgerService.java):\n  - Automatically mines the **Genesis Block** on startup.\n  - Mines a new cryptographically chained block (with previous hash pointers and Proof-of-Integrity nonce) for every qualification issuance or revocation.\n  - Full cryptographic chain validator (`validateChain()`) to detect an\n<truncated 1891 bytes>\nf), [`outputs.tf`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/terraform/outputs.tf) for AWS VPC, ALB, ECS Fargate, and PostgreSQL RDS database.\n- **Kubernetes Production Manifests**: [`k8s/deployment.yaml`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/k8s/deployment.yaml), [`k8s/service.yaml`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/k8s/service.yaml), [`k8s/ingress.yaml`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/k8s/ingress.yaml).\n\n---\n\n### 🧪 **Automated Quality Gates & Test Suite**\n\n| Quality Gate | Status | Details |\n| :--- | :---: | :--- |\n| **Checkstyle Static Analysis** |  **Passed** | `mvn checkstyle:check` — **0 violations** |\n| **Automated Test Suite** |  **Passed** | **35 / 35 tests passed** (0 failures, 0 errors, 0 skipped) |\n| **JaCoCo Code Coverage** |  **Passed** | Quality gate met (>80% coverage on core business logic) |\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 **Live URLs & Demo Access**\n\nThe server is **currently running** and listening on **port 8080**:\n\n| Interface | URL |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| 🎓 **New Welcome Landing Page & Public Verifier** | **[http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080)** |\n| 📊 **Institution & Telemetry Dashboard** | **[http://localhost:8080/dashboard](http://localhost:8080/dashboard)** |\n| 🤖 **AI Verification Assistant** | Floating widget on [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) |\n| ⛓️ **Blockchain Block Explorer** | Embedded table on [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) & Dashboard |\n| 📜 **Audit Trail Log** | **[http://localhost:8080/audit](http://localhost:8080/audit)** |\n| 📖 **Interactive Swagger / OpenAPI Docs** | **[http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html](http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html)** |\n\nDetailed documentation of all changes is recorded in the [Walkthrough Artifact](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/brain/dbeb5914-02b0-421e-b3f2-bf49be569d2f/walkthrough.md).","truncated_fields":["content"]}
